00:05:23.123 --> 00:05:25.783
The initiative aligns with sustainable development goals,

00:05:25.783 --> 00:05:31.223
4, 11, 12, and 14, and showed no significant gender differences and outcomes.

00:05:32.679 --> 00:05:37.499
Specific intronic splicing events in the stat 2 gene have percent spliced in values that

00:05:37.499 --> 00:05:42.459
correlate with response rates and overall survival in patients with non-small cell lung cancer

00:05:42.459 --> 00:05:46.139
