00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:04.370
Scientists at the MRC Laboratory of Medical Sciences engineered glowing biological reporters

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:09.210
that keep their accuracy when imaging gene activity and living plants across days and weeks

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:11.510
in work carried by Fizz.org.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:16.830
The dual color system separates immune link transcriptional responses from background signals.

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:22.290
The approach supports longitudinal observation of plant reactions to disease, pests, and

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:26.210
environmental stress without repeated tissue sampling or destructive harvesting.

00:06:27.144 --> 00:06:32.884
Single photons absorbed in a superconductor generated individual magnetic flux quanta that

00:06:32.884 --> 00:06:35.424
researchers at AIST observed directly.

00:06:35.944 --> 00:06:39.684
The number of quanta produced provides a direct readout of the photon count.

00:06:40.104 --> 00:06:45.004
That observation establishes a new operating principle for photon number resolving detectors

00:06:45.004 --> 00:06:47.964
that does not rely on existing energy threshold methods.

00:06:47.964 --> 00:06:54.104
The same AIST group performs simple chemical modifications on common sugars, including sucrose

00:06:54.104 --> 00:06:54.964
and fructose.

00:06:55.484 --> 00:07:00.144
The altered sugars self-assembled into carbonaceous materials that displayed either controlled

00:07:00.144 --> 00:07:03.204
nanoporosity or ordered layered nanostructures.

00:07:03.864 --> 00:07:08.644
The process operates without complex templating agents or high temperature catalytic steps

00:07:08.644 --> 00:07:13.724
and opens routes to tailored carbon materials from inexpensive abundant feedstocks.

00:07:13.724 --> 00:07:19.506
Tohoku University researchers identified specific molecular structural motifs that enhance

00:07:19.506 --> 00:07:25.666
binding affinity and selectivity for per and polyfluoroalcal substances, or PFAS in

00:07:25.666 --> 00:07:26.646
