00:07:27.346 --> 00:07:32.946
The analysis supplies concrete design criteria for synthesizing next-generation adsorbent materials.

00:07:33.606 --> 00:07:38.406
Existing adsorbents frequently exhibit limited capacity or poor performance under realistic

00:07:38.406 --> 00:07:39.966
water chemistry conditions.

00:07:39.966 --> 00:07:45.908
A validated panel of marker genes now tracks differentiation stages of pluripotent stem

